## $ handoff away "Merge when the reviewers approve."
away (#1): your go-ahead stands until you run handoff back
Under it, an item is approved once every reviewer it was sent to approves the same commit; one approval is enough for an item sent to one reviewer. handoff doesn't read your words: to tell the agents something without approving anything, use handoff fyi.
told implementer, reviewer and reviewer-2 (#2, #3, #4)
handoff: told the operator: Your go-ahead is recorded (#1): Merge when the reviewers approve. Until you run handoff back, items are approved without asking you.
# exit 0
